ort strange lights descending from the sky. When a reporter arrives to investigate, a ragtag group of teens from a lawless neighbourhood storm the scene and steal his camera. In the hands of its new owners, the device records a mesmerising plunge into their frantic existence.","kind":"movie","rating":10,"certification":null,"runtime":84},{"id":"cmrhwdos300sdns75nrdgcmh7","title":"Manipulation","subtitle":"2026 • 16","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1x4hItxtqWdzmxeTypyLNIuOwnz.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4t2Yhj1Dwkp4YutxySurHIkr4cC.jpg","overview":null,"kind":"movie","rating":10,"certification":"16","runtime":0},{"id":"cmrhwjv21017qns75os2xdt21","title":"ASLEEP","subtitle":"2025 • NR","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Fkv7EoGEaYSPpDigkB6lsL0ajQ.jpg","backdropUrl":null,"overview":"A depressed girl daydreams of being abducted by aliens to escape her mental torment.","kind":"movie","rating":10,"certification":"NR","runtime":3},{"id":"cmrhw6mq400auns751dd1bu0r","title":"The Amazing Digital Circus: The Last Act","subtitle":"2026 • NR","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uoZeXWuUS2z2F7VaC1iS5RS5cnk.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uETSwIud6TRC7XFW3hLQK5meMg3.jpg","overview":"With Caine gone and the circus dark, the cast are left with only the mistakes and traumas of their pasts to keep them company. As the prospect of eternity closes in around them, they discover the truth about the Digital Circus and its history. Will they come to terms with what they uncover, or will they make... the other choice? Also, presumably at some point someone says something funny, because this ending can’t be THAT depressing, can it? A theatrical screening of episode 8 and the all new, hour-long episode 9.","kind":"movie","rating":8.795,"certification":"NR","runtime":93}]}}